    "category": "Water meter",
    "type_designations": ["AFlow LXC"],
    "module_designation": "Ultrasonic water meter with electronic indication device",
    "description": "Compact ultrasonic water meter with electronic indication device for measuring, memorizing and displaying the volume of clean water in residential use. Measurement is based on the ultrasonic bidirectional transit-time principle (difference in time-of-flight of ultrasonic pulses downstream vs upstream). Can be installed to operate in all positions and is designed to measure reverse flow. Body available in brass or composite."
